{
  "doc": "A star rating from 1 to 5.\n\nExamples:\n    >>> Rating(score=5).score\n    5\n    >>> try:\n    ...     Rating(score=0)\n    ... except ValidationError:\n    ...     print(\"below range rejected\")\n    below range rejected\n    >>> try:\n    ...     Rating(score=6)\n    ... except ValidationError:\n    ...     print(\"above range rejected\")\n    above range rejected",
